          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon, elap ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei, tocunakinos kilipa, emaikina iyes kiredakis akiron ka nyilot loticisyo kus kitiyata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes yaut neni ke Ekapolon ŋainakineta nu ŋuna epeyo ŋuna ebob eure aneni ke Ekapolon: Emoŋ, emesek ka ŋikaalei ŋikanikaarei ŋulumesekin ŋulu emam neni eŋwalit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom, emaikina iyes yaut ŋakirya ŋuna ajokak ŋuna iguritoe ka akimyet: Ŋakirya ŋakiloi ŋauni aŋuna a emoŋ, ŋakiloi ŋaarei aŋuna a emesek ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka akilo apei aŋuna a ŋinikale a ŋulukanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina daŋ iyes yaut ekoroe erae ainakinet aŋuna ka asecit, yaut kaapei ka ainakinet aŋuna ka asecit ka amookuno kus ta ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋimaten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
