          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes yaut neni ke Ekapolon ŋainakineta nu ŋuna epeyo, ŋuna ebob eure aneni ke Ekapolon: Ŋimoŋin ŋulusorok ŋitomon ka ŋiuni, ŋimeesekin ŋiarei ka ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon ŋulu erae apolou kec ekaru epei, ido tomam neni eŋwalit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom, emaikina iyes yaut ŋakirya ŋuna ajokak ŋuna iguritoe ka akimyet: Ŋakirya ŋakiloi ŋauni aŋuna a ŋolomoŋ a ŋulutomon ka ŋiuni, ŋakiloi ŋaarei aŋuna a ŋolomesek a ŋuluarei ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
