        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋina etupakini ŋin, emaikina iyes yaut ŋimoŋin ŋulusorok ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, ŋimeesekin ŋiarei ka ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon ŋulu erae apolou kec ekaru epei ŋulu emam neni eŋwalit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
