              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina daŋ yaut ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋikinyom ka ŋuna a ŋimaten aŋuna a ŋimoŋin ka aŋuna a ŋimeesekin ta aŋuna a ŋinikale lopite ŋolo elimunitere alokisil aŋuna a ekimar kec. ",
