        {
          "text": "Ani epete ŋirwa ŋiuni, emaikina iyes yaut ŋimoŋin ŋulusorok ŋitomon ka epei, ŋimeesekin ŋiarei ka ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon ŋulu erae apolou kec ekaru epei, ŋulu emam neni eŋwalit. ",
