        {
          "text": "Emaikina daŋ yaut ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋikinyom ka ŋuna a ŋimaten aŋuna a ŋimoŋin ka a ŋimeesekin ta aŋuna a ŋikaalei, lopite ŋolo elimunitere alokisil aŋuna a ekimar kec. ",
