        },
        {
          "text": "Ani, epete ŋirwa ŋikan, emaikina iyes yaut ŋimoŋin ŋulusorok ŋikanikaomwon, ŋimesekin ŋiarei ka ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon ŋulu erae apolou ekaru epei, ŋulu emam neni eŋwalit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
