              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina daŋ yaut ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋikinyom ka ŋuna a ŋimaten aŋuna a ŋimoŋin ka ŋimeesekin ta aŋuna a ŋikaalei lopite ŋolo elimunitere alokisil aŋuna a ekimar kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
