        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina daŋ iyes yaut ekoroe erae ainakinet aŋuna ka asecit, yaut kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina epeyo ŋina a ŋinakoloŋit kaapei ka ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom ta ŋina a ŋimaten.",
