              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes yaut ŋainakineta nu ŋuna epeyo, ŋuna ebob eure aneni ke Ekapolon: Emoŋ, emesek ka ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋikanikaarei ŋulu erae apolou kec ekaru epei, ŋulu emam neni eŋwalit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
