              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina daŋ yaut ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋikinyom ka ŋuna a ŋimaten aŋuna emoŋ, aŋuna a emesek ka aŋuna a ŋikaalei lopite ŋolo elimunitere alokisil aŋuna a ekimar kec. ",
          "type": "text",
