        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes yaut neni ke Ekapolon ŋainakineta ŋun alorwa a ŋulu a ŋasuban a ŋuna etubunitoe. Emaikina iyes yaut ŋainakineta ŋun kaapei ka ŋainakineta ŋuna ikoŋitotor iyes, ŋainakineta ŋuna ka acamit a ŋinituŋanan ikwapei ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo, ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋikinyom, ŋuna a ŋimaten ta ŋainakineta ŋuna ke ekisil.",
